WEBVTT

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:05.370
All right, here are the coupons for driving home the sale this month.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.170
Make sure you make them count.

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:08.550
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:12.490
We haven't had beer coupons for a while now.

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:16.180
Why do you care?

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.790
They're for our readers.

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:19.750
Oh, no reason, really...

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:23.730
You'd better not be using them for yourself.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:26.300
Of course not.

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:31.460
Oh look, it's an entrance coupon to Waterland!

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:34.560
The wave pool there is amazing!

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:36.580
You've been before, then?

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:39.880
No, I just saw their ad on TV.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:45.390
Actually, I've never really been anywhere during summer break,

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:50.220
but that's why I was always able to win the perfect attendance prize for the radio contests.

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.530
Pretty impressive, huh?

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:59.110
And that's why we'll need four more tickets, Chief.

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:00.330
What are you talking about?

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:05.850
You're right. Sorry, we're actually going to need <i>five</i> more.

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:07.170
Why do you need more?

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:08.980
Oh, you!

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:13.010
What do you think you're doing? Let go.

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:13.000
You know you want to go, too!

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:16.120
Are you going to wear your school bathing suit, Chief?

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:17.430
Or a one piece?

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:19.080
But bikinis are nice too.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:22.320
There's no place for the material to stick on little girls' bikinis,

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:24.140
so they slip off so easily.

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:26.180
Slips right off, I say!

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:30.200
Slips off, slips off! It simply slips off!

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:33.360
The bikini slips off so easily!

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:40.090
I'll distribute these coupons myself.

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:46.580
Grandma, it looks like I'm going to have another fun day.

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:51.800
Slips off, slips off.... already slipped off.

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:54.610
Slip slip.

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:55.140
MAKE IT STOP!

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:00.710
What I meant to say is, today will be another trying day!

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:03.960
I'll try my best, Grandma!

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:40.240
My First Time at the Pool

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:47.200
The Chief took all our Waterland tickets.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:49.280
Yeah, because she was scared you would steal them.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:50.810
How dare you?!

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:54.900
I never said I wouldn't give them to the customers.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:56.220
Then I'm sorry I said that.

00:03:56.740 --> 00:04:00.890
I really am too careless though.

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:02.660
I don't pass them out fast enough,

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:06.040
and they get very close to their expiration date.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.920
Which is really too bad. Such a waste.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:10.000
Then you just have to sell them.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:14.410
You "get more" when you use them for yourself.

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:16.950
Don't you think so, Yume?

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:20.590
Yeah, considering how expensive pool admission is,

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:23.050
Haruharu's idea makes more sense.

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:24.310
You can't let her take you in like that.

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:26.120
These coupons are for our readers.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.350
Oh, that's right!

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:33.200
We have so many different coupons to offer our readers.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:36.100
We often give out detergent and stuff as well.

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:40.050
We don't have enough for all our readers though,

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:43.760
so it's usually the ones who whine the loudest who get them.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.790
Tell me about it.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.820
I have some really annoying people on my route who

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:50.240
keep pestering me to give them theater tickets.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:52.680
And they have the nerve to always ask for them in pairs!

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:56.440
Sounds like they really like the theater.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.380
As if.

00:04:58.580 --> 00:04:59.440
Listen up.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:04.160
One theater ticket is 4,500 yen, times two, that comes to 9,000 yen.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:07.870
It costs 3,500 yen to buy a one month subscription to our paper.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:10.170
Oh, oh!

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:13.290
Yuuki, don't you have customers like that too?

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.280
Yeah.

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:19.780
Don't you have any freebies?

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.490
Well, my apologies,

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:24.530
but I am neither your servant, nor your maid,

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:25.670
so I won't be able to provide you with any.

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:28.430
Rejection

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:31.010
Yeah, I guess that happens now and then.

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:33.080
That sounds like something you'd do!!!

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:38.440
I think I understand now why the Chief confiscated the coupons.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.380
Yeah, huh?

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:45.270
I forgot I was making tea!

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:53.240
I guess we won't be going to the pool this time.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.210
Hey Yuuki!

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.100
You too, Hina-chan and Haruharu. Listen up.

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:02.540
Whisper whisper. Whisper whisper.

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:04.360
Sorry for the wait!

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:06.150
The tea is ready!

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:07.380
Then let's go!

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:07.840
Huh?

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:11.890
Kana-chan, will you come shopping with us?

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:12.900
Uh, sure!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.790
Come on, is this a joke?

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.150
I'm terribly sorry, miss, but...

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.400
This is outrageous!

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:27.190
Why on earth do you not sell old-fashioned school swimsuits!

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:29.590
We don't know her, we don't know her!

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:33.750
Who does Haruka-san want to dress up in that swimsuit?

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:36.820
But what are we doing in the...

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:39.090
swimsuit section?

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:41.370
Because we're getting ready for...

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:42.670
...the pool!

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:50.800
Summer is all about going to the pool!

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:54.760
It really is about going to the pool!

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:58.860
No matter if the summer is hot or cold...

00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:02.970
If it's summer, you've got to get into a pool!

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:06.860
People who can swim need to go to the pool.

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:10.840
Even people who can't swim need to go to the pool.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:14.960
Whether it's the crawl or the breaststroke,

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:16.780
or even the butterfly,

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:18.990
or the backstroke...

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:22.330
Come to Waterland!

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:24.550
Uhm... uh?

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:28.330
So, let's all go to Waterland!

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:29.300
Really?

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:31.620
We'll just buy our own tickets.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:34.050
It should be pretty cheap on a weekday morning.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:36.100
But I...

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:39.370
If you're going to a pool...

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:42.330
there is something you simply must have...

00:07:44.470 --> 00:07:46.510
a bathing suit, of course!

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:50.340
If at all possible... a school bathing suit.

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:54.280
And if it was the old-fashioned kind.... My god!

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:56.240
What?!

00:07:57.590 --> 00:08:00.440
But they don't sell them here.

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:04.210
I ask and I ask, but they don't sell them here.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:08.210
The disappointment of disappointments.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:10.220
Uhm, Haruka-san?

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:16.040
But we mustn't give up! We mustn't, no no!

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:19.890
Look at all these bathing suits!

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:26.370
I'm sure we'll find the perfect...

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.270
...bathing suit!

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.860
Come, my harem.

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:38.970
You guys! Don't get caught up in her antics!

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:40.670
Kana-chan,

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:42.890
why don't you try this one on?

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:45.110
But I'm not really interested in buying a bathing suit...

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:46.060
Come on, come on.

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:48.360
Why did you come in the dressing room with me?!

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.090
To help you, of course!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:51.450
But I'm fine by myself...

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:52.680
Don't worry!

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.670
Haruka-san, why are you touching me there?!

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:58.350
Don't worry, it's fine!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:01.500
Good thing she's a woman.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.480
Yeah.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:05.180
Because she's so pretty, right?

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:07.500
Uh, yeah. That's why.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.000
We've reached the limit.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:11.960
I'm exhausted.

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:14.120
Thanks for waiting!

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:16.750
Did you get everything you wanted?

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:20.760
Yuuki and I both got bathing suits.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.660
I did too!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.540
Don't tell me that's...

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.380
Where's Hina-chan?

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:31.420
Sorry I'm late!

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:33.400
What's all that?

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:36.760
My little brothers and sisters asked me to get all these things.

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:39.170
Really?

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:40.990
Hey, Kana-chan.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:42.710
Here you go.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:45.360
What's this?

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.500
We got you a bathing suit.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.330
Really?

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:52.050
Don't worry; it's not Haruka's school suit.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:55.750
You didn't get that one?!

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:57.900
After I finally found one...

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.860
Thank goodness.

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:02.700
I mean...

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:05.050
I can't accept this.

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:06.570
Why not?

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:11.250
Because there's no reason for you to buy something like that for me.

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:15.250
But it wouldn't be the same if you didn't go with us.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:18.950
I want us all to go together,

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:21.410
so I'm actually doing this for myself too.

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:23.010
No,

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:27.410
for all of us, actually.

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:34.230
Summer is all about going to the pool.

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:39.150
It really is about going to the pool.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:43.380
No matter if the summer is hot or cold...

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:47.190
If we don't all go together, it's not summer!

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:51.580
Let's all go to Waterland!

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:54.550
All right...

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:07.630
Thank you... so much!

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:14.940
Summer is all about going to the pool... right?

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:31.080
You all have guts for ditching work like this.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:34.180
What the hell have you been up to all this time?!

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:35.760
Well, about that...

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:39.320
We were buying bathing suits!

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:42.770
So let's all go to Waterland!

00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:43.800
So tell me...

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:47.610
You're going to wear a school swimsuit... right?

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:52.850
You're welcome to go on your day off.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:54.570
I'm off on Wednesday and Saturday.

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:55.900
Tuesday and Friday.

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:56.870
Monday and Wednesday.

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:58.550
Sunday.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:01.400
That's what I'm talking about.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:04.090
We all have different days off, so there's no way we could ever

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:06.320
go to the pool together.

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:10.160
Now that you got that through your thick skulls, 
why don't you get back to work?

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:22.730
The Chief is a demon... even if she's cute.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:24.590
She's not even a little demon...

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:26.670
She's a bona fide demon!

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:27.250
A demon!

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:28.160
A demon!

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:29.810
Say what you want.

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:31.920
Uhh....

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:36.820
The Chief is a demon...

00:12:36.990 --> 00:12:38.740
Even if she's cute...

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.930
But still quite the demon.

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:42.600
The Chief is a demon!

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:43.210
A demon!

00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:44.220
A demon!

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:47.220
If you don't stop this nonsense, there will be a pay cut!

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:48.660
I said it, a pay cut!

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:52.660
A demon, a demon, a demon, a demon!

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.360
The Chief is a demon!

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:55.740
A demon, a demon!

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:57.490
Uhm... well...

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:58.460
What?!

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.220
It's nothing!

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:07.260
Aww man!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.600
And we even got bathing suits!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:13.450
I wanted to go with everyone to Waterland!

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:15.130
Well, I guess that's that.

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:17.180
Work comes first.

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:21.020
That's right. Let's all do our best!

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:28.810
Well, we could still go to Waterland in spirit.

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:29.450
Huh?

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:39.290
I'm leaving for the evening delivery, Chief.

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:43.580
See you lat- What?!

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:55.380
See you later, Chief!

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:56.900
Everyone,

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:59.970
are we really going like this?

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:03.530
Yup! So let's go!

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:12.740
Stop right there! You guys!

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:22.470
We are working girls, working girls.

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:24.670
Every morning and every night,

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:26.670
we deliver newspapers.

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:28.700
We deliver newspapers.

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:32.720
From early in the morning when the shadows of the night still linger,

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:39.280
until the evening dusk, when we work while we smell dinner!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:46.710
Sometimes, dogs bark at us, and it's very scary.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:51.870
People pretend they're not home, and that is very sad.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:57.410
There are times when we don't want to give up certain coupons.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:15:02.740
And there are times when we are caught in the rain and get cold.

00:15:02.740 --> 00:15:07.910
And there are times when we're pushed over by the wind!

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:09.260
Even so!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:15.830
We are working girls, working girls;

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:21.930
we zip around on our bikes and deliver newspapers!

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:25.510
Spring, summer, fall, winter - all year round!

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:29.950
We don't have a single day of rest all week.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:34.360
Our newspaper is a daily one, so...

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:41.540
We work, we work, we work, we work...

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.000
We work!

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:54.080
I'm too embarrassed to make deliveries wearing only this!

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:56.230
Did you see that?

00:15:56.750 --> 00:16:00.080
I did! You mean the Fuushin Gazette's thing, right?

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:01.840
It really is incredible!

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:03.350
I mean, that is just wow!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.330
I saw it, it was just so, you know, right?!

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:08.150
What are they talking about?

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:10.490
What's going on?

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:23.170
It doesn't really feel like a normal delivery, huh?

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.880
Yeah, huh?

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:26.470
Wait a minute...

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:26.930
Huh?

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.500
I just thought of something good!

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:31.450
Something good?

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:32.940
That's right!

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:35.810
If you want to see our show,

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:39.040
please buy a subscription to the Fuushin Gazette!

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:41.110
What show are you talking about?

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:43.420
I want one, I want one!

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:44.970
Great success!

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:46.390
You're right...

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:49.550
The most important thing in the world today... is money!

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:51.740
No, Hina-chan, it's love.

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:56.380
So, I have a subscriber to the morning edition here...

00:16:56.380 --> 00:16:58.680
And over there, someone who would like the sports page.

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:01.130
You want the morning and evening edition?

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:02.770
That is so generous!

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:06.080
Yuuki, this person says he wants one too!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.040
Okay.

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:13.970
I hope we won't be seen... by the police...

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:17.690
I see the Fuushin Gazette will stoop to anything to get readers.

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:22.000
Why are you in a bathing suit too?

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:23.450
Isn't it obvious?

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:26.210
Because I can't just stand around and do nothing while

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:27.640
you guys snap up all these new subscribers!

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:29.890
I'm fighting back!

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:31.930
Good luck with that...

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:34.490
Why are you taking me with you?

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.270
I'm shy... I don't want to be seen like this!

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:37.990
Everyone!

00:17:38.310 --> 00:17:41.730
Sign up for the Kajitsu Sun! Buy the Kajitsu Sun!

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:43.230
Geez!

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:45.670
Mika-chan, aren't you embarrassed?

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:55.380
I am a working girl, a working girl.

00:17:55.790 --> 00:18:02.260
Every morning and every night, I deliver newspapers.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:09.700
We are girls who work very hard!

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:11.650
We work very hard.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:18.210
Everybody, everybody, how about some newspapers?

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:22.810
If you're embarrassed, stay in the back!

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:24.740
But I'm not embarrassed!

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:25.690
Don't lie to me!

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:27.240
Your face is beet red!

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:28.700
So is yours though.

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:30.320
What?!

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:39.120
From early in the morning when the shadows of the night still linger,

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:44.860
until the evening dusk, when we work while we smell dinner!

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:47.730
Yes, yes, yes!

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:52.990
Sometimes, dogs bark at us, and it's very scary.

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:55.750
Sometimes, people pretend not to be home,

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:58.220
and it's very sad.

00:18:58.220 --> 00:19:03.570
There are times when we don't want to give up certain coupons.

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:08.920
And there are times when we are caught in the rain and get cold.

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:13.480
And there are times when we're pushed over by the wind!

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:14.810
Even so!

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:18.380
We are...

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:22.220
...working girls. Working girls.

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:26.300
We zip around on bicycles, delivering newspapers.

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:28.350
Delivering newspapers.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:31.950
Spring, summer, fall, winter - all year round!

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:36.260
We don't have a single day of rest all week.

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:39.660
Our newspaper is a daily one.

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:41.040
Which is why...

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:45.990
Newspapers are better than the 'net!

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:58.940
The Fuushin Gazette

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.230
We're back, Chief.

00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:04.110
We got so many new subscribers!

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:06.120
Good job!

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:08.790
What are you doing?

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:17.970
This is a pool, isn't it? A pool!

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:19.500
What else would it be?

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:20.330
Did you buy it?

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:21.270
You can't be serious.

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:23.640
I found it in the storeroom.

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:26.660
Can we get in?

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.040
Sure...

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.630
Yes!

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:38.380
This feels great! Get in, everyone!

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:39.880
Come on, Yuuki!

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:40.770
All right.

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:45.440
Come on, Kana-chan! Jump in!

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:48.270
Maybe your swimsuit will slip!

00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:53.230
This feels great.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:56.230
Gets rid of the workday sweat too; two birds with one stone!

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.910
Aren't you getting in Kana?

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:03.060
Then let's get in together, Chief.

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:04.720
I'm fine.

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:05.640
No, you're not!

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:07.380
We all have to get in together!

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:08.600
That's right!

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:20.890
Oh, I do like bathing suits,

00:21:20.890 --> 00:21:24.280
but there's something to be said for wet clothes.

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:26.490
When they get all translucent...

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:28.210
You!

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:31.930
Chief, projectiles are not allowed!

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:33.850
Shut up!

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:53.290
I really am having fun with everyone, Grandma.

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:58.660
But I'm having so much fun, that it almost scares me...

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:44.980
My First Time At the Bath With Everyone

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:35.620
My first time at the bath with everyone. Reminds me of Los Angeles.

00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:36.810
Sweet Yume.

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:37.980
Me-media!

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:39.520
Ah, I love you, Yume.

00:23:39.830 --> 00:23:40.970
Me-menu.

00:23:40.970 --> 00:23:44.980
Menu... Yume, Yume, Yume...

00:23:42.870 --> 00:23:44.970
Uhh...
